readme=f'''# J4 v3.3 — Optical Illusion Evidence Gate\n\n**Basis:** v3.2 (read from existing local files), additive-only.\n\n- 25/25 shots mapped to an institution or artist artwork source.\n- 46/46 swappable assets inherit at least one shot-specific optical reference.\n- 10/10 memory arcs map to a shot/artwork reference.\n- {sum(r['category']=='PERCEPTUAL' for r in rows)} perception effects; {sum(r['category']=='TEMPORAL_AUDIOVISUAL' for r in rows)} audiovisual/temporal; {sum(r['category']=='NARRATIVE_RECONTEXT' for r in rows)} narrative reinterpretations.\n- {sum(r['mapping_strength']=='直接' for r in rows)} direct mechanism analogues; {sum(r['mapping_strength']=='類比' for r in rows)} conceptual analogies. 'Direct' refers to mechanism similarity, not permission to reproduce.\n- No artwork images/videos/audio embedded in files; no third party artwork copied.\n- No changes to canonical source shots, audio, timecodes, credits, or generation gates.\n- 25 x 5 = 125 G2 review records all NOT_RUN.\n\n## File list\n- `ART_ILLUSION_REFERENCE_BIBLE_v3_3.md` complete 25-shot sourced catalogue and 3 P0 arcs.\n- `j4_illusion_ir_v3_3.json` machine-readable shot mappings, prompts and review states.\n- `j4_25shot_illusion_references_v3_3.csv` tabular reference mapping.\n- `j4_46asset_illusion_dependencies_v3_3.json` asset swaps -> artwork and shot dependencies.\n- `j4_10memory_arc_evidence_v3_3.json` arc-specific mappings.\n- `j4_g2_art_illusion_qc_v3_3.csv` five non-automatically passable gates per shot.\n- `SOURCE_REGISTER_v3_3.csv` source URLs and licensing distinction.\n- `j4_art_illusion_review_board_v3_3.html` offline board to review one shot and copy prompt delta.\n- `validate_v3_3.py` lightweight static validator.\n\nNo G1 or G2 signoff is implied. Before generation: explicit Neon approval + Director estimated cost posted in AI Video Production Service + verified monthly ≤9000 point headroom + rights review.\n'''
